Hi,

Bit of a newcomer here commenting on hack stuff.

1. Discovered the date on the save file is important.  One day I
   stopped execution of autoexec.bat causing the program that sets
   my date not to set the date.  I, of course, ignored the date setting
   for which DOS prompted and was left with good ol' Jan. 1,1980.
   I started up my saved gamed, played, and resaved (now with old date).
   Upon resuming later, NH told me file was "Out of date." or some such
   thing.  I tried to be clever and change the DOS date on it which
   then caused NH to do all sorts of fun things ("Dungeon collapses.",
    "Error -699.", "Program in disorder.", "You panic.", etc.).
    That game was history.  So, watch your date.

2.  Finally got to Wizard.  Felt clever when I used a spell to create
    a cockatrice which  I killed and weilded and turned him to stone.
    (actually had some previous experience with Wizard and knew he would
     come back if I just hacked at him).  So then I chipped his statue
    away with my pickaxe and THEN took the rocks and spread them around.
    He STILL came back!  How do you get rid of him?  Or don't ya?

3. Most useful things I've experienced: esp amulet with blindfold and
   intrinsic teleport with teleport control.

